<description>&lt;p&gt;In Kashmir, the senior superintendent of police in Srinagar has ordered intensified security checks, expedited criminal case disposal, and a crackdown on drug and organized crime networks. The police chief of Jammu and Kashmir held a high level security review meeting focusing on intelligence sharing and area domination across the valley. In Manipur, tribal students warned of intensified agitation demanding scholarship releases, while security forces recovered a Maoist weapon dump in Bijapur forests of Chhattisgarh and killed a suspected KCP cadre. Lateef Bhat was killed in Kulgam and security officials said the ISI is planning fresh attacks in Jammu and Kashmir; 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE45UkYzTGZfeXBvMGNVcC1wbFdMdUlzTzZvSlRTSS04Q2dGNU9fM1pvbkVBSnpVVTVLX1VXVE5xY2ViRTQwRW1BUENmT19VUU1KQlNwOGhKVHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNdUlfZF9aZzFxcTdEcmFTNldpcnRKRGcwWnRmU1hSSkZXSnpza0NYbE5fNXpHdFhTN1VvQkdxQzhkVDgwVzFfb1JCemNpNjduYmtJajFEckhLaWJ1Z0E1YnRzWnlFVHdVTDZQaWpDLWZaNXFQb0t6V2lVMmdfNWtpRkYwSnFiUUhyWE5aSzd3UkpjQUNRQ29hWkU5ek53UFhSTld4cVhHR3F0SDFGMGgyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NorthEast India24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNT010cDV1ZlRXc0diQkR2VWNLZFJ4ZG9XQkRUX25ydGRLaVBPbnJ2c05BOVdwZ3hWYW9lbTlEakx3TEJJU3FHdjk5R2hmQnVqS1BLc3NhSE1DMi1kX2kwM2hnaVpKdW5vMVpHM2RRUG9oTURSa2lkU180bUhCRVZMYmkwQUNkVllGSlBPLUxEa0xjQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ommcom News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNLWkxbEtjLTZVbk4wR09Mbll5aEZFYXZTSUJYb25wTVdTekRsSlVOY0ZtMFhWVldud2hsUzRsTmZ1T1ZOeEZPTXpCNThEVTZtdXZMcmdNeU9rMnRxZk1HQ19ETWxXcXc3UkZncVBsZnRmcC1Ed0hPUWZtc3liZUhOZWxRTEZTZGR1NEVONFNaR3dxZjQ0S